        {
          "text": "Nkabela naakali kweenda kumbali lyalwizi lwaku-Galilaya wakabona babunyina bobile, Simoni uutegwa Petro, amwanike wakwe Andreya, bakali mukuwaala lusabwe mumaanzi, nkaambo kabali bazubi. ",
